                            <comment id="14742503" author="jongyoul" created="Sun, 13 Sep 2015 14:57:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;How to reproduce this error.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run another webserver like tomcat with the port number of 8080&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run zeppelin-daemon.sh start&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Check logs
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Can find a BindException into the .log&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Check jstack
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Cannot find &apos;org.apache.zeppelin.server.ZeppelinServer.main()&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
